<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48551" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θεσσαλ-ός</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θεττ-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <u>Thessalian</u>,
			<i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			5.63
		</span></i>, etc.: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θ. σόφισμα</span> a
			<u>Thessalian</u> trick, <i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Ph.</u>
			1407
		</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θ. νόμισμα</span>, i.e. false money, <i><span class="en">
			Phot.
		</span></i>; Thess. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πετθαλός</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			9(2).258
		</span></i>(<span class="entity">Cierium</span>), <i><span class="en">
			517.14
		</span></i> (<span class="entity">Larissa</span>); 
			Boeot.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φετταλός</span></b>  (as pr. n.) ib.<i><span class="en">
			7.2430.8
		</span></i>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> pr. n. of a physician of
			the Methodic School:—hence Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θεσσάλειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.763
			</span></i>,al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> fem.
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θεσσαλίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, <u>Thessalian</u>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυνῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					314
				</span></i>
			: as Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θετταλίς, ἡ</span>, a kind of <i>shoe</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lysipp.
				2
			</span></i>.</div>
